# Windows' git defaults to converting LF to CRLF on checkout. That silently
# broke `cargo test` there: bindings_test.rs compares src/bindings.ts, read
# raw from disk, against a string ts-rs builds with hardcoded \n — a real
# file identical to what's committed still fails with CRLF line endings.
# Force LF everywhere so a checkout is byte-identical on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
